    case SCon{Chr{U32{WCon{True{}, WCon{True{}, WCon{True{}, WCon{True{}, WCon{False{}, WCon{True{}, WCon{False{}, WCon{False{}, WCon{False{}, WCon{False{}, WCon{False{}, WCon{False{}, WCon{False{}, WCon{False{}, WCon{False{}, WCon{False{}, WCon{False{}, WCon{False{}, WCon{False{}, WCon{False{}, WCon{False{}, WCon{False{}, WCon{False{}, WCon{False{}, WCon{False{}, WCon{False{}, WCon{False{}, WCon{False{}, WCon{False{}, WCon{False{}, WCon{True{}, bits}}}}}}}}}}}}}}}}}}}}}}}}}}}}}}}}}, t}:
      E.absurd({Support.free(SCon{Chr{U32{WCon{True{}, WCon{True{}, WCon{True{}, WCon{True{}, WCon{False{}, WCon{True{}, WCon{False{}, WCon{False{}, WCon{False{}, WCon{False{}, WCon{False{}, WCon{False{}, WCon{False{}, WCon{False{}, WCon{False{}, WCon{False{}, WCon{False{}, WCon{False{}, WCon{False{}, WCon{False{}, WCon{False{}, WCon{False{}, WCon{False{}, WCon{False{}, WCon{False{}, WCon{False{}, WCon{False{}, WCon{False{}, WCon{False{}, WCon{False{}, WCon{True{}, bits}}}}}}}}}}}}}}}}}}}}}}}}}}}}}}}}}, t} ++ R.query_text(q)) == True{} : Bool} & ({B.split_target(SCon{Chr{U32{WCon{True{}, WCon{True{}, WCon{True{}, WCon{True{}, WCon{False{}, WCon{True{}, WCon{False{}, WCon{False{}, WCon{False{}, WCon{False{}, WCon{False{}, WCon{False{}, WCon{False{}, WCon{False{}, WCon{False{}, WCon{False{}, WCon{False{}, WCon{False{}, WCon{False{}, WCon{False{}, WCon{False{}, WCon{False{}, WCon{False{}, WCon{False{}, WCon{False{}, WCon{False{}, WCon{False{}, WCon{False{}, WCon{False{}, WCon{False{}, WCon{True{}, bits}}}}}}}}}}}}}}}}}}}}}}}}}}}}}}}}}, t} ++ R.query_text(q)) == (SCon{Chr{U32{WCon{True{}, WCon{True{}, WCon{True{}, WCon{True{}, WCon{False{}, WCon{True{}, WCon{False{}, WCon{False{}, WCon{False{}, WCon{False{}, WCon{False{}, WCon{False{}, WCon{False{}, WCon{False{}, WCon{False{}, WCon{False{}, WCon{False{}, WCon{False{}, WCon{False{}, WCon{False{}, WCon{False{}, WCon{False{}, WCon{False{}, WCon{False{}, WCon{False{}, WCon{False{}, WCon{False{}, WCon{False{}, WCon{False{}, WCon{False{}, WCon{True{}, bits}}}}}}}}}}}}}}}}}}}}}}}}}}}}}}}}}, t}, q) : String & Maybe<&2, String>} & {P.target_form(m, SCon{Chr{U32{WCon{True{}, WCon{True{}, WCon{True{}, WCon{True{}, WCon{False{}, WCon{True{}, WCon{False{}, WCon{False{}, WCon{False{}, WCon{False{}, WCon{False{}, WCon{False{}, WCon{False{}, WCon{False{}, WCon{False{}, WCon{False{}, WCon{False{}, WCon{False{}, WCon{False{}, WCon{False{}, WCon{False{}, WCon{False{}, WCon{False{}, WCon{False{}, WCon{False{}, WCon{False{}, WCon{False{}, W